#import "/commands.typ": *

// woodcore:object heading title
== Serviceability criteria
// woodcore:/object title

// woodcore:object text p1
It must be verified that the design value of the effects $E_d$ (e.g. deformations) of the governing load cases remains less than or equal to the serviceability limit $C_d$ specified (SIA 260, 4.4.4.2):
// woodcore:/object p1

// woodcore:object text p2
$ E_d <= C_d $
// woodcore:/object p2

// woodcore:object text p3
The serviceability verifications concern functionality, comfort and appearance (4.3.2.1); the criteria may relate to deformations, vibrations, defective sealing and construction-specific effects such as cracks or slip in connections (4.3.2.2). The serviceability limits $C_d$ are specified in line with the service criteria agreement (4.4.2.8).
// woodcore:/object p3
